{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1117619-dark-eras-early-middle-ages-resources","id":1117619,"title":"[Dark Eras] Early Middle Ages resources","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-17T23:13:09-07:00","id":1117619,"title":"[Dark Eras] Early Middle Ages resources","content":"I run Viking Era <i>Wolf &amp; Raven</i> game of Werewolf, circa 800 A.D. - but found out that I have some gaps in knowledge of the period. Would ask nicely for some ideas or hints where to look.<br /> <br /> On first comes Early Middle Ages names - I need to name 3 Lancea Sanctum vampires in Isle Iona abbey. Best would be other monks also to have named. So question is simple - <b>What are popular Early Middle Ages names of period in Europe?</b> Are they all Roman and Latin ones?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-02-2017, 05:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T23:29:48-07:00","id":1117624,"title":"","content":"You might wanna read Sagas of the Icelanders. It's a beautiful little game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"